Subject: [M155] NavigationEntryScreenshot waits for in-flight readbacks before
 release

Original change's description:
> NavigationEntryScreenshot waits for in-flight readbacks before release
>
> When an asynchronous readback of a screenshot's shared image is in
> progress, the screenshot or its SharedImageProvider could be destroyed
> or released before the read access completes on the GPU.
>
> This change tracks the read sync token generated upon ending raster read
> access. When releasing or destroying the provider, the read sync token
> is combined with any pending release sync token to ensure the GPU
> finishes reading the image before it is reused or deleted.
>
> The token is cleared once the readback completes or when the context is
> lost so that no additional IPCs are issued in the happy path.
>
> Fixed: 568827293
